      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَافَّ نَاقَتَكَ</span></b>  <i>Milk thou thy camel after the
first milking.</i> (S, O, L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعافّ</span> said
to a sick man, <i>Treat thyself medically.</i> (K.)
One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِأَىِّ شَىْءٍ نَتَعَافُّ</span> <i>With what thing shall
we treat ourselves medically ?</i> (AA, O, TA.)

